    <main class="policy-container">
        <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
        <p><strong>Last Updated: October 12, 2025</strong></p>
        <p>At Happy Tails, we want you and your pet to be completely satisfied with your purchase. If you are not satisfied for any reason, you may be eligible for a refund subject to the terms below.</p>

        <h2>Eligibility for a Refund</h2>
        <p>To be eligible for a refund, you must meet the following conditions:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Your refund request must be made within <strong>14 days</strong> of the delivery date.</li>
            <li>The item must be unused, in the same condition that you received it, and in its original packaging.</li>
            <li>You must provide a receipt or proof of purchase.</li>
            <li>Items that are damaged, defective, or incorrect upon arrival are eligible for a full refund or exchange.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Non-Refundable Items</h2>
        <p>Certain types of items cannot be returned or refunded, including:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Perishable goods such as pet food and treats.</li>
            <li>Customized or personalized items.</li>
            <li>Items marked as "Final Sale" or on clearance.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Refund Process</h2>
        <p>To initiate a refund, please contact our customer support team at <strong>support@happytails.com</strong> with your order number and a brief description of the issue. For damaged items, please include a photo.</p>
        <p>Once your return is received and inspected, we will notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund. If approved, your refund will be processed, and a credit will automatically be applied to your original method of payment within 7-10 business days.</p>
    </main>

